{"title": "Infested (Bursting Brood) (Condition)", "pageid": 56153, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infested_(Bursting_Brood)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Physical Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Infested</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Crawling with tiny spiders that deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4 Piercing damage</span> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4 Necrotic damage</span> each turn.</li>\n<li>At the start of your turn you can make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to try and remove the infestation. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diseased\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diseased_(status_group)\" title=\"Diseased (status group)\">Diseased</a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SPIDER_INFESTATION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSPIDER_INFESTATION%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSPIDER_INFESTATION%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Disease\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SG Disease\">SG_Disease</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Infested\">Sources of Infested</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bursting_Brood\" title=\"Bursting Brood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bursting Brood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bursting_Brood\" title=\"Bursting Brood\">Bursting Brood</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SPIDER_INFESTATION</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Infested\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infested_(Condition)\" title=\"Infested (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infested\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Infested_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Infested_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infested_(Condition)\" title=\"Infested (Condition)\">Infested</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Crawling with tiny spiders that deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4 Piercing damage</span> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">1d4 Poison damage</span> each turn.</li>\n<li>When hit with a melee attack, the infestation spreads to the attacker. Upon death, the infestation spreads to all nearby creatures.</li>\n<li>Removed by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage.</li>\n<li>Doesn't harm <a href=\"/wiki/Ettercap\" title=\"Ettercap\">ettercaps</a> or spiders.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Infested\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infested_(Bursting_Brood)_(Condition)\" title=\"Infested (Bursting Brood) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infested\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Generic_Physical_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Infested</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Crawling with tiny spiders that deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4 Piercing damage</span> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4 Necrotic damage</span> each turn.</li>\n<li>At the start of your turn you can make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> to try and remove the infestation.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202541\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2128/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27909/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8393/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.034/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1344824/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.151      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   67.151      1 -total\n 55.74%   37.432      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 26.78%   17.984      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 22.92%   15.393      7 Template:Icon_text\n 19.32%   12.975     27 Template:Trim\n 18.74%   12.581      5 Template:Icon_link\n 17.59%   11.809      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.61%    9.141      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 12.41%    8.332      1 Template:MdSAI\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:56153-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202541 and revision id 378812. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}